 "insight": [
  "In 2025, Luxembourg's main product chapters imported from Japan and China were machinery and mechanical appliances, electrical machinery and equipment, and articles of iron or steel.",
  "Total imports amounted to 1.89 billion euros, with machinery and mechanical appliances making up 1.03 billion euros or 54.5% of imports.",
  "Electrical machinery and equipment was the second largest import at 768.9 million euros, representing 40.7% of total imports.",
  "The top three product chapters accounted for 96.0% of all imports from these countries.",
  "The values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
